 Go does not stat them, and under `-mod=vendor` the stream reports them
 unchanged when the directory they name does not exist.
 
-Within `R/vendor/modules.txt` only a module annotation line carries a
-replacement: a line whose first two bytes are exactly `# ` and which contains
-the exact ASCII bytes ` => `. The replacement is the whitespace-separated token
-sequence following the first such occurrence on that line. Exactly one token is
