    applies.
 3. After `go list` returns, the manager reads the effective replace set from
    `<build root>/vendor/modules.txt` exactly as Protocol Core section 4.2.3
-   defines it, rejects every module-to-module redirect and every versioned
-   replacement target, resolves each directory-form target against the build
-   root, and checks the one-to-one correspondence with the declared list in
