 | `build_module_root_declaration_unused` | `unsupported` | `error` | A declared module directory is named by no effective replacement |
 
diff --git a//Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/curator-spec/.temp/STORY-260822-1pm1c9/prose-worktree/protocol/core.md b//Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/curator-spec/.temp/STORY-260822-1pm1c9/prose-worktree/protocol/core.md
